  "notes": [
    "Sprites sourced from spritedatabase.net (HeartGold/SoulSilver overworld rip, credited on-sheet to ripper 'Grim').",
    "Each source block has 8 32x32 columns: 0-3 = down-facing walk (4 authentic frames), 4-5 = one side-facing pose (2 frames), 6-7 = the same pose mirrored horizontally (confirmed 100% pixel-identical to an hflip of columns 4-5 for all 12 species).",
    "Left/right facing was determined by visual inspection (Bulbasaur's snout points left in column 4, right in column 6) and applied uniformly.",
    "The source sheet contains NO back/up-facing art. The 'up' row in every delivered PNG is a placeholder that duplicates the 'down' row -- see the per-Pokemon 'directions.up' entry (authentic: false) in this manifest.",
    "Transparency was produced by flood-filling each frame's background from its four corners (the source uses a soft cyan vignette per cell, not a single flat color), not a fixed color-key."
  ],
